# The image ships the PRESET home only (the tracked seed: cordis.patch.yml, the
# profile's package.json + patch). Everything else under home/ is runtime state
# the harness writes in a container — dev attachments by bind mount, the rest in
# the container layer — and must never enter the build context: COPY home would
# bake it into the image, and a root-owned 0600 file kills the build with
# "error from sender: permission denied". Mirrors the home entries in .gitignore.
home/attachments
home/sessions
home/storages
home/settings.yaml*
home/.credentials.yaml
home/.anonymous-user-id
home/profiles/*/cordis.yml
**/.DS_Store
